      "source": [
        "## Text Preprocessing\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Clean the new news headlines, handle word normalization, and prepare the text for vectorization.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "105f103f"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "I will define the text preprocessing function and apply it to the new headlines DataFrame to clean the text, remove non-alphabetic characters, and normalize whitespace as per the instructions.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 192
        },
        "id": "8c521101",
        "outputId": "2cbb3f64-5a58-4e57-be45-9ea876fe0423"
      },
      "source": [
        "import re\n",
        "\n",
        "def preprocess_text(text):\n",
        "    # Convert to lowercase and remove all characters that are not lowercase letters or spaces\n",
        "    cleaned = re.sub(r'[^a-z\\s]', '', text.lower())\n",
        "\n",
        "     # Normalize whitespace using split and join\n",
        "    return ' '.join(cleaned.split())\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create the 'Cleaned_Headline' column by applying the preprocessing function\n",
        "df_new_headlines['Cleaned_Headline'] = df_new_headlines['Headline'].apply(preprocess_text)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Print the first few rows to verify the transformation\n",
        "print('Updated New Headlines DataFrame:')\n",
        "df_new_headlines.head()"
      ],
      "execution_count": 34,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
