      "source": [
        "# Task\n",
        "Perform topic modeling on the news headlines using Non-negative Matrix Factorization (NMF). Preprocess the text by tokenizing, removing stopwords, and applying lemmatization using NLTK. Convert the cleaned text into a Bag of Words (BoW) matrix and apply NMF to discover underlying topics. Finally, extract the top keywords for each topic and assign the most relevant topic to each original headline."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5ce2efe4"
      },
      "source": [
        "## preprocess_with_lemmatization\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Clean the headlines, tokenize, remove stopwords, and apply lemmatization using NLTK to prepare the corpus.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
