      },
      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "I will import the NLTK library, download the necessary resources, and define a preprocessing function that tokenizes, removes stop words, and applies lemmatization to the headlines to create a refined 'Lemmatized_Headline' column.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
