    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9bc16bb3"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "I will use CountVectorizer to transform the lemmatized headlines into a Bag of Words matrix and then convert this matrix into a structured pandas DataFrame to inspect the frequency of the terms before applying NMF.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 255
        },
        "id": "9519d01c",
        "outputId": "ca52b035-b40c-4828-97e2-315242485148"
      },
      "source": [
        "from sklearn.feature_extraction.text import CountVectorizer\n",
        "\n",
        "# Initialize CountVectorizer for the lemmatized text\n",
        "vectorizer_nmf = CountVectorizer()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Fit and transform the lemmatized headlines to create a BoW matrix\n",
        "bow_matrix_nmf = vectorizer_nmf.fit_transform(df_new_headlines['Lemmatized_Headline'])\n",
        "\n",
        "# Convert the matrix into a DataFrame using the feature names\n",
        "df_bow_nmf = pd.DataFrame(bow_matrix_nmf.toarray(), columns=vectorizer_nmf.get_feature_names_out())\n",
        "\n",
        "# Display the Bag of Words DataFrame\n",
        "print('Bag of Words (BoW) DataFrame for Lemmatized Headlines:')\n",
        "df_bow_nmf"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
