      "source": [
        "# Task\n",
        "Update the 'preprocess_text' function to include stop word removal using NLTK's English stop words list. Re-run the CountVectorizer, LDA, and NMF models to update the results based on the cleaned text, and then summarize how the removal of stop words impacted the identified topic keywords and overall model results."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3a83a624"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Update Preprocessing with Stop Word Removal\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Modify the text cleaning function to filter out NLTK stop words from the headlines.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "4c77a0e1"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "I will update the `preprocess_text` function to include NLTK stop word removal and apply it to the headlines DataFrame as requested in the instructions.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 227
        },
        "id": "f87f463c",
        "outputId": "acec726d-a02a-4ddd-86af-9ec41a73da07"
      },
      "source": [
        "import nltk\n",
        "from nltk.corpus import stopwords\n",
        "import re\n",
        "\n",
        "# Ensure the 'stopwords' corpus is downloaded\n",
        "nltk.download('stopwords')\n",
        "\n",
        "# Get the set of English stop words\n",
        "stop_words = set(stopwords.words('english'))\n",
        "\n",
        "def preprocess_text(text):\n",
        "    # Convert to lowercase and remove all characters that are not lowercase letters\n",
        "    cleaned = re.sub(r'[^a-z\\s]', '', text.lower())\n",
        "    # Tokenize by splitting\n",
        "    words = cleaned.split()\n",
        "    # Filter out stop words\n",
        "    filtered_words = [word for word in words if word not in stop_words]\n",
        "    # Join the words back into a single string\n",
        "    return ' '.join(filtered_words)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Update the 'Cleaned_Headline' column by applying the revised preprocessing function\n",
        "df_new_headlines['Cleaned_Headline'] = df_new_headlines['Headline'].apply(preprocess_text)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Display the updated DataFrame to verify the removal of stop words\n",
        "print('Updated Headlines with Stop Word Removal:')\n",
        "df_new_headlines[['Headline', 'Cleaned_Headline']]"
      ],
